              [1mF      [22mopen file for writing.  [1mF [22mis omitted in default display mode.
              [1mr      [22mroot directory.
              [1mm      [22mmmap'ed file or shared library.
              [1m.      [22mPlaceholder, omitted in default display mode.

       [1mfuser [22mreturns a non-zero return code if none of the specified files is accessed or in case of a fatal error.  If at least one access has been found, [1mfuser [22mreturns zero.

       In  order to look up processes using TCP and UDP sockets, the corresponding name space has to be selected with the [1m-n [22moption. By default [1mfuser [22mwill look in both IPv6 and IPv4 sockets.  To change the default behav‐
       ior, use the [1m-4 [22mand [1m-6 [22moptions.  The socket(s) can be specified by the local and remote port, and the remote address.  All fields are optional, but commas in front of missing fields must be present:

       [[4mlcl_port[24m][,[[4mrmt_host[24m][,[[4mrmt_port[24m]]]

